The brief gives no betting odds for Belgium. It names Sweden as the overwhelming favorite and lists Ireland, Turkey and Switzerland as other contenders. The brief is also unreliable on some points. The artist and song details are inconsistent, and its claim that Austria is hosting after a Nemo win may be misdated. I am discounting those details and relying on its description of the field.

Belgium is mentioned as a participant with some fan enthusiasm, but nothing indicates it is a top favorite. The base rate across 35 entries is about 3%, and Belgium has not won since 2003. The brief says only that Belgium has "strong fan support", and that is weak evidence. I put the probability slightly below the uniform base rate.


